  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/lrtactical.png\" alt=\"\"> 为 Timeless and Classics Guns Zero (TACZ) 添加投掷物、近战武器，并提供更多枪械包支持</p>\n<h2>内容与特性</h2>\n<p>内置包包含以下内容</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/2025-05-26_16.39.12.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/2025-05-26_16.37.26.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/2025-05-26_16.37.50.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;蝴蝶刀包含于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-x-lr-cs2-knifes-packet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CS2 Knifes Packet</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/2025-05-26_16.38.54.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>近战武器</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/melee.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>匕首</li>\n<li>爪刀</li>\n<li>棒球棍</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>投掷物</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/throwable.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>M67 破片手雷</li>\n<li>RGN 破片手雷</li>\n<li>烟雾弹</li>\n<li>闪光弹</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>战术盾牌</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/shield.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>防暴盾</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/dependency.png\" alt=\"\"> **本模组所需的 TACZ 版本详见下方表格。</p>\n<h2><strong>这是一个 MOD 插件，请将 .jar 文件放入 mods 文件夹，而非 TACZ 枪械包的目录。您需要安装 TACZ 1.1.5 或更高版本作为依赖</strong></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Minecraft 版本</th>\n<th>插件版本</th>\n<th>TACZ 版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.1</td>\n<td>0.2.3</td>\n<td>1.1.5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2>UGC 支持</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/ugc.png\" alt=\"\"> 新增功能：允许为 TACZ 枪械包自定义近战武器与投掷物。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deltaforce-melee-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/11/14/seve.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-x-lr-cs2-knifes-packet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/30/cs2pack.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-lr-trench-tactics-ww1-gadget-packet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">战壕战术 WW1 装备包</a></p>",
